{% comment %}
  CAUCE — carrito lateral. Reskin completo sobre la seccion de bloques de Shrine.

  QUE SE CONSERVA DE SHRINE, y es lo unico: que el carrito sea una SECCION CON
  BLOQUES reordenables desde el theme editor. El comercio prende, apaga y reordena
  las piezas sin abrir codigo, y la configuracion sigue viviendo en
  config/settings_data.json > current.sections["cart-drawer"]. Numen resuelve esto
  con un orden fijo de {% render %} adentro de un snippet: eso es un downgrade.

  TODO LO DEMAS sale del carrito de Numen (Haspert-Theme): el layout, la linea de
  producto compartida con /cart, el reaseguro de una linea, la barra de envio, el
  patron de re-render por AJAX y el criterio de que se muestra y que no.

  Las piezas CAUCE viven en snippets/cauce-carrito-*.liquid y el CSS entero en el
  bloque 17 de assets/cauce-brand.css. Ninguna de las dos cosas declara un hex.

  RE-RENDER — verificado contra assets/main.js de ESTE repo. A diferencia de Dawn y
  de Numen, que re-renderizan dos regiones sueltas (cart-drawer-items y
  .cart-drawer__footer), aca CartDrawerItems.getSectionsToRender() devuelve
  {id:'CartDrawer', section:'cart-drawer', selector:'.drawer__inner'}: se
  re-renderiza el drawer ENTERO en cada cambio de cantidad. Consecuencia practica:
  cualquier bloque, en cualquier posicion, se recalcula solo. No hay que elegir
  region.

  HOOKS QUE NO SE TOCAN (los cablea el JS ofuscado; romperlos no da error, deja de
  funcionar en silencio):
    <cart-drawer data-type="modal"> ... setHeaderCartIconAccessibility lee
                                       dataset[this.dataset.type] del form del header.
    #CartDrawer ...................... contenedor que renderContents reemplaza.
    #CartDrawer-Overlay .............. el constructor le cablea el click de cierre.
    .drawer__inner ................... region de re-render.
    .drawer__inner-empty ............. trapFocus cuando el carrito queda vacio.
    cart-drawer-items ................ custom element que hace el update.
    #CartDrawer-Form / #CartDrawer-CartItems / .js-contents
    #CartDrawer-LiveRegionText / #CartDrawer-LineItemStatus / #CartDrawer-CartErrors
    .cart-drawer__body / .drawer__footer / .drawer__header .... base.css los colapsa
                                       a height:0 cuando el carrito esta vacio.

  Usage:
  {% render 'cart-drawer' %}
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .drawer {
    visibility: hidden;
  }
</style>

{%- liquid
  comment
    El contador ignora los items marcados con el tag cart-hidden, que es como
    Shrine excluye los regalos y upsells automaticos del conteo visible.
  endcomment
  assign non_upsell_count = cart.item_count
  for item in cart.items
    if item.product.tags contains 'cart-hidden'
      assign non_upsell_count = non_upsell_count | minus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

<cart-drawer
  class="drawer{% if cart == empty %} is-empty{% endif %}{% if section.settings.test_mode %} active{% endif %}"
  data-type="modal"
>
  <div id="CartDrawer" class="cart-drawer">
    <div id="CartDrawer-Overlay" class="cart-drawer__overlay"></div>
    <div
      class="drawer__inner cauce-carrito gradient color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.title' | t }}"
      tabindex="-1"
    >
      {%- if cart == empty -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Va PRIMERO en el DOM a proposito: cuando el carrito se vacia el JS hace
          trapFocus(..., cartDrawer.querySelector('a')) — el primer <a> de todo el
          drawer — y ese tiene que ser el CTA del empty state. El boton de cerrar
          es un <button>, asi que no compite.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="drawer__inner-empty">
          <div class="cart-drawer__warnings">
            <div class="cauce-carrito__cabecera">
              {%- comment -%}
                Mismo titulo que la cabecera de arriba, para que cambiarlo en el
                editor no deje dos nombres para la misma pieza. El [count] resuelve
                a 0, que es lo cierto en un carrito vacio.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <h2 class="cauce-carrito__titulo">
                {{ section.settings.heading_text | replace: '[count]', 0 }}
              </h2>
              <button
                class="drawer__close cauce-carrito__cerrar"
                type="button"
                onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()"
                aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
              >
                {%- render 'cauce-iconos', icono: 'cruz' -%}
              </button>
            </div>
            {% render 'cauce-carrito-vacio' %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="drawer__header cauce-carrito__cabecera">
        <h2 class="drawer__heading cauce-carrito__titulo">
          {{ section.settings.heading_text | replace: '[count]', non_upsell_count }}
        </h2>
        <span class="cauce-carrito__contador">{{ non_upsell_count }}</span>
        <button
          class="drawer__close cauce-carrito__cerrar"
          type="button"
          onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()"
          aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
        >
          {%- render 'cauce-iconos', icono: 'cruz' -%}
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="cart-drawer__body">
        {% if section.blocks.size == 0 %}
          <p class="cauce-carrito__aviso">
            El carrito no tiene bloques. Agregalos desde la sección "Cart drawer"
            del grupo Header en el editor de temas.
          </p>
        {% endif %}

        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          {% case block.type %}
            {%- comment -%} ---- Bloques CAUCE ---------------------------------- {%- endcomment -%}
            {% when 'trust_line' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__bloque" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-carrito-reaseguro',
                  arrepentimiento: block.settings.mostrar_arrepentimiento,
                  iva: block.settings.mostrar_iva,
                  envio: block.settings.mostrar_envio
                %}
              </div>

            {% when 'progress_bar' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__bloque" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-carrito-envio' %}
              </div>

            {% when 'cart_items' %}
              <cart-drawer-items
                {% if cart == empty %}
                  class=" is-empty"
                {% endif %}
                {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
              >
                <form
                  action="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
                  id="CartDrawer-Form"
                  class="cart__contents cart-drawer__form"
                  method="post"
                >
                  <div id="CartDrawer-CartItems" class="drawer__contents js-contents">
                    {%- if cart != empty -%}
                      <ul class="cauce-carrito__items" role="list">
                        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
                          {% render 'cauce-carrito-linea',
                            item: item,
                            contexto: 'drawer',
                            formato: block.settings.mostrar_formato,
                            por_dia: block.settings.mostrar_precio_dia
                          %}
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </ul>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <p id="CartDrawer-LiveRegionText" class="visually-hidden" role="status"></p>
                    <p id="CartDrawer-LineItemStatus" class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true" role="status">
                      {{ 'accessibility.loading' | t }}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <div id="CartDrawer-CartErrors" role="alert"></div>
                </form>
              </cart-drawer-items>

            {% when 'product_upsells' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__bloque" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-carrito-nudge' %}
              </div>

            {% when 'legal_note' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__legal" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-disclaimer', compacto: true %}
              </div>

            {%- comment -%}
              ---- Bloques de Shrine que quedan disponibles y sin reescribir ------
              No hay ninguna instancia de estos hoy. Se conservan sus ramas para
              que agregarlos desde el editor siga funcionando; su markup y sus
              settings son los de Shrine, asi que no toman el sistema CAUCE.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {% when 'checkpoints_bar' %}
              {% render 'cart-checkpoints-bar', block: block, items_count: non_upsell_count %}

            {% when 'countdown_timer' %}
              {% capture timer %}
                <countdown-timer data-duration="{{ block.settings.timer_duration }}"></countdown-timer>
              {% endcapture %}
              <div class='cart-timer color-{{ block.settings.color_scheme }}' style="--font-size:{{ block.settings.font_size }}rem;--margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {{ block.settings.timer_text | replace: '[timer]', timer }}
              </div>

            {% when 'gift' %}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'body' %}
                {% liquid
                  if block.settings.display == 'globally'
                    assign display = true
                  else 
                    assign display = false
                    assign handles_array = block.settings.display_product_handles | replace: ' ', '' | split: ','
                    if handles_array contains product.handle
                      assign display = true
                    endif
                  endif
                %}
                {% if display %}
                  {% render 'cart-gift', block: block, items_count: non_upsell_count %}
                {% endif %}
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'text_with_icon' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'body' %}
                {% render 'text-with-icon-block', block: block, margins: true, block_attributes: true %}
              {% endif %}
            {% when 'image' %}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'body' %}
                <div 
                  class="product-info__image-block" 
                  style="--image-width:{{ block.settings.width }}%;--image-alignment:{{ block.settings.alignment }};--border-radius:{{ block.settings.border_radius | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;"
                  {{ block.shopify_attributes }} 
                >
                  {% if block.settings.image != blank %}
                    <div class="media media--transparent ratio" style="--ratio-percent: {{ 1 | divided_by: block.settings.image.aspect_ratio | times: 100 }}%">
                      {%- capture sizes -%}
                        (min-width: {% if section.settings.desktop_width == 'normal' %}430{% else %}580{% endif %}px) calc(370px * {{ block.settings.width | divided_by: 100 }}),
                        calc((100vw - {% if section.settings.mobile_width == 'partial' %}60{% else %}30{% endif %}px) * {{ block.settings.width | divided_by: 100 }})
                      {%- endcapture -%}
                      {{
                        block.settings.image
                        | image_url: width: 1500
                        | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: sizes, widths: '165, 360, 535, 750, 1070, 1250, 1500'
                      }}
                    </div>
                  {% else %}
                    {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg placeholder' }}
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'icon_with_text' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'body' %}
                {% render 'icon-with-text',
                  block: block
                %}
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'custom_liquid' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'body' %}
                {{ block.settings.custom_liquid }}
              {% endif %}
          {% endcase %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="drawer__footer">
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          {% case block.type %}
            {%- comment -%} ---- Bloques CAUCE ---------------------------------- {%- endcomment -%}
            {% when 'subtotals' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__totales" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {%- if cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
                  <ul
                    class="cauce-carrito__descuentos"
                    role="list"
                    aria-label="{{ 'customer.order.discount' | t }}"
                  >
                    {%- for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
                      <li>
                        {{- discount.title | escape }} (−{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }})
                      </li>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </ul>
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- comment -%}
                  role="status" en el total: al cambiar una cantidad el drawer se
                  re-renderiza entero y un lector de pantalla tiene que enterarse
                  del monto nuevo sin ir a buscarlo.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="cauce-carrito__total" role="status">
                  <span class="cauce-carrito__total-label">{{ 'sections.cart.subtotal' | t }}</span>
                  <span class="cauce-carrito__total-monto">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
                </div>

                {%- if block.settings.mostrar_ahorro -%}
                  {%- assign cauce_ahorro = cart.original_total_price | minus: cart.total_price -%}
                  {%- if cauce_ahorro > 0 -%}
                    {%- assign cauce_ahorro_money = cauce_ahorro | money -%}
                    <p class="cauce-carrito__ahorro">
                      {{- 'cauce.carrito.ahorro' | t: monto: cauce_ahorro_money -}}
                    </p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}

                <small class="cauce-carrito__impuestos">
                  {%- if cart.taxes_included and shop.shipping_policy.body != blank -%}
                    {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_included_and_shipping_policy_html' | t: link: shop.shipping_policy.url }}
                  {%- elsif cart.taxes_included -%}
                    {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_included_but_shipping_at_checkout' | t }}
                  {%- elsif shop.shipping_policy.body != blank -%}
                    {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_and_shipping_policy_at_checkout_html' | t: link: shop.shipping_policy.url }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_and_shipping_at_checkout' | t }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </small>
              </div>

            {% when 'payment_benefit' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__bloque" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-carrito-pago' %}
              </div>

            {% when 'checkout_btn' %}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__ctas" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <noscript>
                  <button type="submit" class="cauce-carrito__seguir" form="CartDrawer-Form">
                    {{ 'sections.cart.update' | t }}
                  </button>
                </noscript>
                {%- comment -%}
                  Los dos contenedores de aviso quedan porque los usa el bloque
                  tnc_checkbox de Shrine, que sigue disponible.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="tnc-checkbox-warning tnc-checkbox-warning--above-button hidden"></div>
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  id="CartDrawer-Checkout"
                  class="cauce-carrito__cta"
                  name="checkout"
                  form="CartDrawer-Form"
                  {% if cart == empty %}
                    disabled
                  {% endif %}
                >
                  <span>{{ 'sections.cart.checkout' | t }}</span>
                  {%- if block.settings.mostrar_monto -%}
                    <span class="cauce-carrito__cta-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="cauce-carrito__cta-monto">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </button>
                <div class="tnc-checkbox-warning tnc-checkbox-warning--under-button hidden"></div>
                {%- if block.settings.mostrar_pagos_rapidos and additional_checkout_buttons -%}
                  <div class="cart__dynamic-checkout-buttons additional-checkout-buttons">
                    {{ content_for_additional_checkout_buttons }}
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.mostrar_seguir -%}
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="cauce-carrito__seguir"
                    onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()"
                  >
                    {{ 'general.continue_shopping' | t }}
                  </button>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>

            {%- when 'payment_badges' -%}
              <div class="cauce-carrito__pagos" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'cauce-medios-pago', alineacion: 'center' %}
              </div>

            {%- comment -%}
              ---- Bloques de Shrine que quedan disponibles y sin reescribir ------
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {% when 'discount_field' %}
              {% render 'cart-discount-field', block: block %}
            {% when 'cart_note' %}
              <details id="Details-CartDrawer" style="--margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <summary>
                  <span class="summary__title">
                    {{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}
                    {% render 'icon-caret' %}
                  </span>
                </summary>
                <cart-note class="cart__note field">
                  <label class="visually-hidden" for="CartDrawer-Note">{{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}</label>
                  <textarea
                    id="CartDrawer-Note"
                    class="text-area text-area--resize-vertical field__input"
                    name="note"
                    placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}"
                  >{{ cart.note }}</textarea>
                </cart-note>
              </details>
            
            {%- when 'tnc_checkbox' -%}
              <div style="--margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <style>
                  .tnc-chekcbox {
                    font-size: {{ block.settings.checkbox_text_size | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
                  }
                  .tnc-checkbox-warning {
                    font-size: {{ block.settings.warning_text_size | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
                    text-align: {{ block.settings.warning_alignment }};
                    color: {{ block.settings.warning_text_color }};
                  }
                </style>
                <tnc-chekcbox
                  class='tnc-chekcbox flex flex-align-center{% if block.settings.checkbox_alignment == 'center' %} center flex-justify-center{% endif %}'
                  data-checked="false"
                  data-disable-button="{{ block.settings.disable_checkout_button }}"
                  data-warning-text='{{ block.settings.warning_text }}'
                  data-warning-position='{{ block.settings.warning_position }}'
                >
                  <svg
                    class="checkmark-checked text-color-{{ block.settings.checkbox_color }} flex-shrink-0"
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    width="50"
                    height="50"
                  >
                    <path d="M64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96V416c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H384c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V96c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64H64zM337 209L209 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L303 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <svg
                    class="checkmark-unchecked text-color-{{ block.settings.checkbox_color }} flex-shrink-0"
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    width="50"
                    height="50"
                  >
                    <path d="M384 80c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16V416c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16H64c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16V96c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16H384zM64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96V416c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H384c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V96c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64H64z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <p class="tnc-checkbox__text margin-0">
                    {{ block.settings.checkbox_text }}
                  </p>
                </tnc-chekcbox>
                <div class='tnc-checkbox-warning tnc-checkbox-warning--under-checkbox hidden' style='margin-top: 0.4em;'></div>
              </div>
            {% when 'gift' %}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'footer' %}
                {% liquid
                  if block.settings.display == 'globally'
                    assign display = true
                  else 
                    assign display = false
                    assign handles_array = block.settings.display_product_handles | replace: ' ', '' | split: ','
                    if handles_array contains product.handle
                      assign display = true
                    endif
                  endif
                %}
                {% if display %}
                  {% render 'cart-gift', block: block, items_count: non_upsell_count %}
                {% endif %}
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'text_with_icon' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'footer' %}
                {% render 'text-with-icon-block', block: block, margins: true, block_attributes: true %}
              {% endif %}
            {% when 'image' %}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'footer' %}
                <div 
                  class="product-info__image-block" 
                  style="--image-width:{{ block.settings.width }}%;--image-alignment:{{ block.settings.alignment }};--border-radius:{{ block.settings.border_radius | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;--margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;"
                  {{ block.shopify_attributes }} 
                >
                  {% if block.settings.image != blank %}
                    <div class="media media--transparent ratio" style="--ratio-percent: {{ 1 | divided_by: block.settings.image.aspect_ratio | times: 100 }}%">
                      {%- capture sizes -%}
                        (min-width: {% if section.settings.desktop_width == 'normal' %}430{% else %}580{% endif %}px) calc(370px * {{ block.settings.width | divided_by: 100 }}),
                        calc((100vw - {% if section.settings.mobile_width == 'partial' %}60{% else %}30{% endif %}px) * {{ block.settings.width | divided_by: 100 }})
                      {%- endcapture -%}
                      {{
                        block.settings.image
                        | image_url: width: 1500
                        | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: sizes, widths: '165, 360, 535, 750, 1070, 1250, 1500'
                      }}
                    </div>
                  {% else %}
                    {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg placeholder' }}
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'icon_with_text' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'footer' %}
                {% render 'icon-with-text',
                  block: block
                %}
              {% endif %}
            {%- when 'custom_liquid' -%}
              {% if block.settings.position == 'footer' %}
                {{ block.settings.custom_liquid }}
              {% endif %}
          {% endcase %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</cart-drawer>
